WEBVTT

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:13.650
Sorry you have to drop me off too.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:17.350
Don't mention it. Consider it thanks
for letting me enjoy the play.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.160
It's a shame you two weren't in it,

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.630
but Heathcliff was amazing.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:25.610
Ikumi-san made her wardrobe!

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:28.960
Oh? Is that so, Kyoko?

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.430
Sorry, I'm late.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.500
It was unreal...

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.250
Seeing the great Heathcliff in tears.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:46.490
Did something happen?

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:49.990
Kagami-sensei said something to her
and she just burst into tears.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.420
She must have had an emotional outburst.

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.240
We're beginning the reflection meeting.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:56.810
OK!

00:00:58.090 --> 00:00:59.060
Kyoko...

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:00.950
Kyoko.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.170
What's wrong?

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.100
It's nothing.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.270
It's in the past now.

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:45.900
I was in love, me alone,

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:47.970
and that's all there was to it.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:53.390
I wonder if I'm betraying you somehow.

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:56.590
That's...

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:02.490
Take my hand and bid farewell to darkness.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:06.490
I'm going to take you to my secret place.

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:09.490
Where you're as you are.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.700
Close your eyes, don't be afraid.

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:17.000
Yeah.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:19.960
Oh, Fumi-chan?

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:23.090
Yeah, well the play was yesterday, so...

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:24.500
Huh?

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:27.930
Oh... That sounds fun.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:31.510
I'm fine,

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:34.160
but do you have a day off
from school today, too?

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.310
I'm playing hooky.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:38.370
...and boom goes the dynamite.

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:42.570
And then I remembered that
you don't have school today.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:44.830
I'm sorry.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:51.110
All right. Then we'll go on an all-day date!

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:52.900
About that...

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:55.910
I bought this...

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:57.080
Yokohama 
Minato Mirai - Chinatown

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:41.370
This place is great, even on a weekday.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:42.510
Yeah.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.090
I'll be right back.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:53.310
Wow, look at all those text messages!

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:54.220
Your boyfriend?

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.070
I'm not telling.

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:58.000
What gives? Tell me!

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.140
Come on, it's not a big deal.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:04.850
Manjome-san?

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.830
She's not in yet.

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:10.730
Were you two supposed to
meet up or something?

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.780
I'm gonna be running the basketball team
for the first time in a while tomorrow.

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.730
Wanna come and watch?

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:18.990
Was I stood up?

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:29.300
I feel like I wanna stay at your
place tonight, Achan...

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:31.360
Sure.

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:33.680
Are you OK wearing a pair of my pajamas?

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.790
Oh, maybe they won't fit on you.

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:39.340
I can ask my mom for a
pair of hers, maybe...

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:41.420
Achan...

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:42.290
At your service!

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:43.730
You're too kind.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:48.840
I'll be dependent on you forever
if you don't start saying no.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.990
Yeah, I dunno about all that...

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:58.910
"Did something happen between
you and Sugimoto-sempai?"

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:03.840
...I wonder if asking that would
be a good idea or not.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:07.100
She's so quick to cry...

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.600
I hate girls who cry.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.350
What?!

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:20.730
Stop being so wishy-washy and
I'll let you sleep over.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:27.700
I did something mean...

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.230
Huh? To Sempai?

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:30.620
Yeah.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:31.940
Don't worry about it.

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:34.000
She's a little too popular anyway.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:37.130
No offense to her, but I'm on your side.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:40.000
Thank you, Achan.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.360
Quit being so formal.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.520
You'd better make up with her.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:45.350
Right.

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:49.410
I need to confront her more directly, huh?

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:54.300
And if we break up over that, maybe
we just weren't meant to be.

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:57.420
Good night.

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.720
Good night.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.450
Hey!

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.980
Someone's getting yelled at.

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:14.740
Maybe it's Okudaira-san.

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:17.520
State your name and class.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:20.570
First year, Fuji class,

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.450
Akira Okudaira.

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.370
Well then, Okudaira-san,

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:28.550
come back down here and walk
up the stairs properly.

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:32.100
I don't care what kind of hurry you're
in, you are not to run in these halls.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.550
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:36.500
Reference Room

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:38.310
Geez... She was scary...

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.190
Man, I was just guessing, too.

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:42.530
You shouldn't have been in such a rush.

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:43.470
Yeah...

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.090
What is it?

00:07:59.090 --> 00:07:59.950
Huh?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:05.470
Oh, that's by Sugimoto-sempai's
older sister.

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:06.300
Huh?

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:08.780
Wow...

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:11.560
Oh, she was a teacher here.

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:12.290
Artist: Kazusa Sugimoto
(Former Fujigaya Faculty)

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:16.870
She taught in the high school
before we got here.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.370
I've met her.

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:20.050
Huh? Why, why?

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:22.500
It was back in middle school.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:26.230
I was asked to go to Sempai's
house, just one time.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.950
She was delicate and beautiful.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:33.790
The so-called Four Sugimoto Sisters
were sort of well known.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.490
Four Sugimoto Sisters?

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:40.440
To Sempai
Sorry for not keeping my promise.

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:45.280
I'll be waiting for you after practice today.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:49.910
If you're willing to forgive me,

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:55.830
I'd like to see you.

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:02.820
Hand me the towel.

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:04.500
Oh, sure thing!

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:11.860
You free on Saturday?

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:13.140
Yes.

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:14.480
Then it's a date.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:18.360
I want to introduce you to my family
too, so come to my place.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:20.000
Sure.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.330
What?!

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.300
Sempai's house?

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:32.360
Yes, on Saturday.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:33.670
Wow!

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:37.910
That means you'll meet the
Four Sugimoto Sisters.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:39.830
Four Sugimoto Sisters?

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.670
She has three older sisters, apparently.

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:46.080
Oh, and one of them was
a teacher at our school.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:48.250
Three sisters?

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:52.100
What should I do? I'm sorta nervous now...

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:54.110
It'll be fine!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:58.860
They said the one who used to be the
teacher is a really nice person.

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:00.350
I see...

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.550
Forget that, Fumi-chan...

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:05.500
Looks like you and Sempai
patched things up.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.210
That's great.

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:11.120
Yeah. Thanks.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:28.500
I wonder what her sisters are like...

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:40.240
She asked me out on a date!

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:55.320
She's late.

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:05.210
Fumi.

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:05.730
Huh?

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:08.140
Sorry.

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:09.670
Sempai!

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:12.420
Sorry, there was a lot of traffic.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.360
Did you think I stood you up?

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:24.780
What? No, not at all...

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:28.790
I thought I left with plenty of
time to get here, but...

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.280
No excuses.

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:32.920
Right, right.

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.890
Thanks, Ogino-san.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.990
Sempai.

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:04.880
Sempai's...

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:10.780
Sempai's a...

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:13.290
I'm back.

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:17.240
Welcome home, miss.

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:22.430
...girl from a good family.

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:24.900
What's wrong? Come in.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.640
Pardon me.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.690
Oh, Yacchan, welcome back.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.910
Is this a friend of yours?

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:38.690
Yup, she's two grades below me.

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:42.300
I-I'm Fumi Manjome.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:44.490
I'm her older sister, Shinako.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.270
The eldest sister!

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:03.130
Oh, great, I like tall girls.

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:05.240
We're all tall in our family.

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:07.620
I'm Kuri, the third-eldest sister.

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:08.700
Nice to meet you.

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:10.710
Likewise.

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:26.800
Yasuko sure has her share of admirers.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.070
And so it begins.

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:31.320
Oh, I don't mean it in a bad way.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:33.420
Pay no attention to her.

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:37.920
My mother here used to be rather popular
herself, when she was young,

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.910
so she's just trying to steer the conversation,
to brag with old stories.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:46.750
Hey. Why would you say things that can give
our guest here the wrong impression?

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:49.060
I can't help it if it's the truth.

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:53.060
You girls are so cruel.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.540
When have I ever bragged
through old stories?

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:57.070
When <i>aren't</i> you telling them?

00:13:57.070 --> 00:14:01.050
Yeah. Remember that time when
I brought my friend over...

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:03.690
Oh yeah, she was terrible that day.

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:04.580
Wasn't she?

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:07.110
Thank you kindly.

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:08.050
All right, all right.
Let's just leave it at that.

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:18.490
Welcome.

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:30.420
Nice to meet you. I'm Kazusa,
the second-eldest.

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:33.380
I'm Fumi Manjome.

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:35.120
Umm,

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:38.470
you taught at Fujigaya...?

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:43.070
Oh, that was only for a brief time.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:49.020
She seems kind, just like Achan said.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:53.470
It's not often Yacchan brings a friend over.

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:55.790
You two must be really close.

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:59.390
Yeah, about that...

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:02.740
I have something I want you all to hear.

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:07.930
Right now, me and her...

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:09.730
are dating.

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:19.800
So you'd be like... girlfriends?

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:22.270
I guess so.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:25.650
You're a lesbian, Yacchan?

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:29.250
Do you really love her?

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:30.580
I do.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.110
<i>Right now</i> you do, right?

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:36.100
Kuri...

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:40.000
You're saying that, at this moment, you love
the girl sitting right there, yes?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:42.980
Knock it off.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.500
I already said I do.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:49.260
Then I guess that would make you bisexual.

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:54.800
Let's go to my room, Fumi.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:58.450
What are you planning on
doing in there with her?

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:03.080
Don't follow her.

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:08.430
She always makes a big fuss like that.

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.630
Then she'll sulk and come right out,

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:13.510
looking for someone to console her.

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:17.020
Honestly, she's our little princess.

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:29.620
Oh, sorry. Is it cool if I smoke?

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.250
Oh, go right ahead.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.870
See? Isn't she mean?

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:37.840
Kuri's always like this.

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:39.510
Well, <i>excuse</i> me.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:10.690
Fumi?

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:11.970
Yes.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.370
Come in.

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:24.010
You have a beautiful room.

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.690
They're always like that.

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:32.580
It's weird, though. I'm so quick
to let them manipulate me.

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:36.950
I'm jealous. I don't have any siblings.

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:42.690
Umm...

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:47.010
I went out with someone before.

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:54.420
"Went out" is an exaggeration. We were
like sisters, only a little more.

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:58.630
I loved her,

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:02.720
but she was probably just fooling around.

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:04.430
And then...

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:09.120
But I met you, and I truly-

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:10.200
Do you?

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:11.270
Huh?

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:15.640
You still have doubts
about me, don't you?

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:18.390
Like I'm still in love with
someone from before.

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:20.120
Right?

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:23.080
What about you then, Fumi?

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:29.540
I just conveniently showed up right
after that person dumped you.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:35.780
Maybe we just <i>thought</i>
it was love at first sight.

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:44.930
So what?

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:49.980
Yacchan, you shouldn't corner people
with questions like that.

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:53.560
That's not very becoming
of a sempai, now is it?

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.920
Now, Fumi-san, come with me.

00:18:58.500 --> 00:18:59.810
It's fine.

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:05.950
<i>You</i> stay there and think
about what you've done.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:18.400
You're in no rush today, right?

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:20.460
Why don't you spend the night?

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.060
Oh no, I couldn't impose.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:24.480
It's no imposition, really.

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:25.850
No, I really couldn't.

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:27.220
We insist.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:32.600
Can you take some food to Yasuko?

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:37.790
You're always so quick to pamper her.

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:38.450
Umm...

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:41.870
Can I take it to her?

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:43.900
Oh, but...

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:46.340
No, I'd be happy to.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:50.910
What a sweet thing for her to do.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:53.290
All right, let's place a bet,

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:56.300
on whether or not Yasuko takes their relationship
to the next level tonight.

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:58.880
Quit saying things like that.

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:01.590
What? You have a guilty conscience?

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:06.890
Now, now, no bickering.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:10.680
Actually, I'd wager to say they already
went to the next level.

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:11.450
Huh?

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.970
Eww! You're the most vulgar
of all of us, Mother!

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:32.430
Your home is so lively.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.720
Sempai, about before...

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:39.810
Listen.

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:42.920
I wasn't being fair to you before.

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:45.080
I'm sorry.

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:50.350
I can't control my emotions
and blamed you for it.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:01.280
As I am right now, I can't be your girlfriend.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:13.650
When the Leaves were New

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:39.870
See you next time.
